// The wheat field (P3 farm content, refs owner-approved under A17: "wheat crop") on meadow_base's
// grass, ahead of the P3 recipes (owner request, 2026-10-19). Grass edges, so it mixes freely with
// meadows and the farm. The centre piece covers a hexagon of apothem 10.8 m with ripe wheat in
// parallel rows along the tile's x on ploughed earth, leaving a 3 m grass margin on every edge;
// rows are 1.2 m apart, so neighbouring fields of one orientation continue each other's rows. The wheat sways in the
// wind and the walker walks through it (its cards are not ground, `scatter::NOT_GROUND`). A few
// wildflowers and rocks stay on the grass margin: scatter only stands on meadow_base_cap.
// The rows turn with the tile, so it has three orientations (owner D5, 2026-10-20: rows at 0, 60 and
// 120 degrees), though its sockets are all grass; a half turn lays the rows on themselves, so
// rotations 3-5 look as 0-2 (`look_period`, hex_core::TileDef::same_orientation).
(
    id: "wheat_field",
    biome: Grass,
    base: "meadow_base",
    center: Some("wheat_field"),
    look_period: Some(3),
    edges: (
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
        (kind: Grass),
    ),
    props: (
        scatter: [
            (piece: "wildflower_clump", density: 1.2, drift: true),
            (piece: "rock_small", density: 0.2),
        ],
    ),
)
